WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.494
Day 2. The first pair.

2
00:00:01.944 --> 00:00:08.756
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.256 --> 00:00:13.073
Here is today's pair. Listen. Two letters make this one sound.

4
00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:18.403
It is the sound you make for quiet. A finger on the lips helps.

5
00:00:21.711 --> 00:00:22.728
The word is sip.

6
00:00:26.481 --> 00:00:27.473
The word is ship.

7
00:00:28.373 --> 00:00:34.504
On the page, the pair has one line under it. One line, one sound. Every other letter has a dot.

8
00:00:34.954 --> 00:00:39.120
There are cards to cut out on the next page. Keep them for the days to come.

9
00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:44.126
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box at the top. Read them out.

10
00:00:44.576 --> 00:00:49.576
Do the four pairs of job one together. The first word, then the word with the pair.

11
00:00:50.026 --> 00:00:54.059
If a word goes wrong, do not say it. Say the same words every time.

12
00:00:54.509 --> 00:00:57.588
Two letters, one sound. Find the pair. Then wait.

13
00:00:58.388 --> 00:01:03.961
For job two, press play for your child and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

14
00:01:04.411 --> 00:01:07.873
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
